              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tim tic peri ceng’ abusiel, man iyom i ceng’ mir abirone; kara koni dhiang’ peri ku kana peri giyom, man wod bong’ peri, man umondo, gidwok cwinygi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man wuketh cwinywu kum gin ceke m’ayero iwu: man kud wuwec pi nying’ mungu mange, kadi ku juwinj maeni i dhogi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.23.13"
            ]
          }
        }
